  "caveats": [
    "All numbers are out-of-fold: every test molecule is scored by a model that never saw it. The stacker, threshold and early stopping are chosen using training data only.",
    "Features exclude pIC50 (the label is derived from it) and canvasUID (a row ID: the file is sorted by class, so it alone gives 0.9998 AUC).",
    "pIC50 is used only as an extra training target for the GNN, never as an input at prediction time.",
    "The deployed demo model is trained on all 1,513 molecules, so its predictions on dataset molecules are not a test. Only the cross-validated numbers above are.",
    "Scaffold splits are harder than random splits by design; report both. Explanations describe model behaviour, not proven binding mechanisms."
  ]
